  "solution": {
    "text": "Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>k&#937;</mi></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;F</mi></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></math>.<br /><br />In this condition, frequency of carrier signal,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>RC</mi></mfrac><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></msub></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></msub></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>kHz</mi></math><br /><br />Since, frequency must be greater than <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kHz</mi></math>&nbsp;the possible answer will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>kHz</mi></math>.",
